{
  "$note": "田宅宮（2026-10-12）：太陰.田宅。《深造講義》下篇 宮垣論 田宅宮 p.556–560。火災、水災、孝服、血光、兵災、官非、倒閉一類斷語不用；風水不用（近「化解」）；添丁、天喜紅鸞、天巫、天刑等不用；要分日夜生、廟陷嘅條文暫不用。",
  "topic": {
    "id": "太陰.田宅",
    "palace": "田宅",
    "stars": [
      "太陰"
    ]
  },
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "田宅.太陰.廟",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "bright": "high",
            "star": "太陰"
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "hua": "忌",
              "star": "太陰",
              "at": "same"
            }
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "star": "太陽",
              "at": "same"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "太陰光亮，太陰主富，對你的家宅有利。",
      "en": "Tai Yin shines brightly, and Tai Yin stands for wealth: it favours your home and property.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.田宅.太陰.1",
        "quote": "故入庙则利宅"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "田宅.太陰.廟吉",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "bright": "high",
            "star": "太陰"
          },
          {
            "any": [
              {
                "hua": [
                  "祿",
                  "權",
                  "科"
                ],
                "at": "same"
              },
              {
                "star": [
                  "左輔",
                  "右弼"
                ],
                "at": "sifang"
              },
              {
                "star": [
                  "天魁",
                  "天鉞"
                ],
                "at": "sifang"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "太陰光亮又見〔吉〕，你的住宅環境寧靜，住得安穩。",
      "en": "Tai Yin shines brightly and meets 〔good signs〕: your home is peaceful.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.田宅.太陰.2",
        "quote": "太阴入庙会吉，主住宅宁静"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "田宅.太陰.陷",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "bright": "low",
        "star": "太陰"
      },
      "text": "太陰光弱，即使盤面吉，你的產業也有盈有虧。",
      "en": "Tai Yin shines weakly: even with good signs, your property has its gains and losses.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.田宅.太陰.3",
        "quote": "虽吉亦有盈亏"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "田宅.太陰.陷煞",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "bright": "low",
            "star": "太陰"
          },
          {
            "star": [
              "擎羊",
              "陀羅",
              "火星",
              "鈴星",
              "地空",
              "地劫"
            ],
            "at": "same"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "太陰光弱又見〔煞〕，你的住宅環境喧鬧，難得清靜。",
      "en": "Tai Yin shines weakly and meets 〔harsh stars〕: your home is noisy.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.田宅.太陰.2",
        "quote": "会煞落陷，则住宅喧闹"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "田宅.太陰.陽",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "star": "太陽",
            "at": "opp"
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "star": "太陽",
              "at": "same"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "太陰與太陽相對，也算「日月合璧」：你的家道興隆，任職的機構也興旺。",
      "en": "Tai Yin facing Tai Yang, what the old books call sun and moon joined: your household prospers, and so does the organisation you work for.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.田宅.太陽.1",
        "quote": "此意亦可用于服务机构"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "田宅.太陰.輔佐",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "any": [
              {
                "star": [
                  "左輔",
                  "右弼"
                ],
                "at": "same"
              },
              {
                "star": "祿存",
                "at": "same"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "hua": "忌",
              "star": "太陽",
              "at": "same"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "太陰與左輔右弼或祿存同宮，你承接祖業而興盛。",
      "en": "Tai Yin with Zuo Fu, You Bi or Lu Cun in the palace: you inherit family property and it prospers.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.田宅.太陰.4",
        "quote": "则承祖业而盛"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "田宅.太陰.忌",
      "role": "limit",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "hua": "忌",
            "star": "太陰",
            "at": "same"
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "star": [
                "擎羊",
                "陀羅",
                "火星",
                "鈴星",
                "地空",
                "地劫"
              ],
              "at": "same"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "太陰化忌而無煞，你家中或任職的機構多是非。",
      "en": "Tai Yin in Obstruction without harsh stars: there is friction at home or at work.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.田宅.太陰.5",
        "quote": "无煞则主家宅或服务机构有是非"
      }
    }
  ]
}